OL,3,GNEWSAOutdoor swimming pool set for
OL,4,A#400,000 upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FFacilities at an outdoor swimming pool
OL,7,Fbuilt in 1936 are set for a #400,000
OL,8,Fupgrade.
OL,10,FA Derbyshire Dales District Council
OL,11,Freport details plans to improve
OL,12,FHathersage Swimming Pool in the Peak
OL,13,FDistrict, 10 miles (16km) north of
OL,14,FBakewell.
OL,16,FThe report states the venue in
OL,17,FOddfellows Road needs an upgrade to
OL,18,Fmeet modern standards, with energy
OL,19,Fefficiency set to be a key feature.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
