OL,3,GNEWSAOutdoor swimming pool set for
OL,4,A#400,000 upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FSolar panels and insulation are
OL,7,Fincluded in the plans, as well as
OL,8,Fupgrades to the reception, staff
OL,9,Fwelfare, first-aid room, and manager
OL,10,Farea, as well as new toilets and a
OL,11,Fdedicated disabled toilet.
